{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xd1I7jNL621793490784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西營盤發生懷疑虐兒案，一名少年受傷送院，其父親涉嫌虐兒被捕。</p><p></p><p>警方凌晨近一時接獲一名14歲少年家人報案，指少年在醫院道一個住宅單位，被其父親不恰當對待，警員接報到場，經初步調查，懷疑其35歲父親曾以手襲擊他，以涉嫌對所看管兒童或少年人虐待或忽略罪將他拘捕，現正被扣留調查。少年眼、手及額頭受傷，清醒送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.691197+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T23:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:58:19.127059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:01.885736+00:00","content_hash":"064b80fe1b188cb9fc92cbe24de22fd7aeb104af2f39bdf9e84116bbd7fd9920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.691197+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}